{"title": "Immutable Form", "pageid": 13248, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Immutable_Form", "categories": ["Bugs", "Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Immutable_Existence\" title=\"Immutable Existence\">Immutable Existence</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Immutable_Form.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Immutable_Form.webp/300px-Immutable_Form.webp, /w/images/9/9d/Immutable_Form.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Immutable_Form.webp/300px-Immutable_Form.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9d/Immutable_Form.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Immutable Form</b> makes the wearer immune to effects like <span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/40px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Polymorphed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Polymorphed_(status_group)\" title=\"Polymorphed (status group)\">Polymorphed</a></span>. Furthermore, gets a +5 bonus to saving throws against <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Banishment\" title=\"Banishment\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Banishment_Icon.webp/20px-Banishment_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Banishment_Icon.webp/30px-Banishment_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Banishment_Icon.webp/40px-Banishment_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Banishment\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Banishment_Icon.webp/20px-Banishment_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Banishment_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Banishment\" title=\"Banishment\">Banishment</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Spells that alter someone's form have no effect on the affected entity, and it has a +5 bonus to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a> against spells that would remove it from this plane.<sup><i>[<a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Bugs\">See: Bugs</a>]</i></sup> \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ansur\" title=\"Ansur\">Ansur</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Apostle_of_Myrkul\" title=\"Apostle of Myrkul\">Apostle of Myrkul</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Flesh\" title=\"Flesh\">Flesh</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hellfire_Watcher\" title=\"Hellfire Watcher\">Hellfire Watcher</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ketheric_Thorm\" title=\"Ketheric Thorm\">Ketheric Thorm</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Milil\" title=\"Milil\">Milil</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Orin\" title=\"Orin\">Orin</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watcher_(creature)\" title=\"Steel Watcher (creature)\">Steel Watcher (creature)</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Prevents any condition in the <span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/40px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Polymorphed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Polymorphed_(status_group)\" title=\"Polymorphed (status group)\">Polymorphed</a></span> status group.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>This effect protects against specifically <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Banishment\" title=\"Banishment\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Banishment_Icon.webp/20px-Banishment_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Banishment_Icon.webp/30px-Banishment_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Banishment_Icon.webp/40px-Banishment_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Banishment\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Banishment_Icon.webp/20px-Banishment_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Banishment_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Banishment\" title=\"Banishment\">Banishment</a> when cast at level 4 and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Shot:_Banishing_Arrow\" title=\"Arcane Shot: Banishing Arrow\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Arcane_Shot_Banishing_Arrow_Icon.webp/20px-Arcane_Shot_Banishing_Arrow_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Arcane_Shot_Banishing_Arrow_Icon.webp/30px-Arcane_Shot_Banishing_Arrow_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Arcane_Shot_Banishing_Arrow_Icon.webp/40px-Arcane_Shot_Banishing_Arrow_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Arcane Shot: Banishing Arrow\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Arcane_Shot_Banishing_Arrow_Icon.webp/20px-Arcane_Shot_Banishing_Arrow_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Arcane_Shot_Banishing_Arrow_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Shot:_Banishing_Arrow\" title=\"Arcane Shot: Banishing Arrow\">Arcane Shot: Banishing Arrow</a>. Any other source of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Banished_(Condition)\" title=\"Banished (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Banished_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Banished_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Banished_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Banished\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Banished_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Banished_(Condition)\" title=\"Banished (Condition)\">Banished</a> such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Banishing_Smite\" title=\"Banishing Smite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp/20px-Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp/30px-Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp/40px-Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Banishing Smite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp/20px-Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3b/Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Banishing_Smite\" title=\"Banishing Smite\">Banishing Smite</a> or upcasted <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Banishment\" title=\"Banishment\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Banishment_Icon.webp/20px-Banishment_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Banishment_Icon.webp/30px-Banishment_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Banishment_Icon.webp/40px-Banishment_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Banishment\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Banishment_Icon.webp/20px-Banishment_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Banishment_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Banishment\" title=\"Banishment\">Banishment</a> will not be affected.</li></ul>\n</div>  <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Immune to form-altering spells. +5 on <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">saving throws</a> against <a href=\"/wiki/Banishment\" title=\"Banishment\">Banishment</a>.</div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200112\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.061 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.068 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2484/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 18899/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9773/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 604/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.019/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 967454/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   57.378      1 -total\n 98.55%   56.546      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 38.43%   22.049      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 36.20%   20.772      9 Template:Icon_text\n 34.38%   19.725      1 Template:PageSeo\n 29.67%   17.022     18 Template:Trim\n 21.24%   12.185      5 Template:SmSAI\n 17.76%   10.189      9 Template:Ifempty\n 17.71%   10.160      6 Template:Icon_link\n 16.95%    9.725      1 Template:Condition_Type\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki: